  "stream_accounting_contract": "OpenAI-compatible SSE delta.content values are text chunks and must not be counted as tokenizer tokens. Token counts are present only when reported by the local runtime or cloud usage metadata.",
  "claim_boundary": "Plan output proves only configuration and policy readiness. Session recovery proves only admission of a caller-reconstructed durable transcript before generation after a completed turn or an incomplete zero-output request; it does not resume partial output or restore KV/hidden state. Caller-supplied network observations and budget estimates are not active probes, learned predictions, device-exclusive energy measurements or cloud billing records. Execute observations prove one request path only and do not prove production availability, model equivalence, cost accounting, mid-generation migration, KV transfer or release readiness."
